WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.430
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.100
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.100
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:35.010
Episode 21

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:35.010
Speed Match! Sonic vs Sam

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:07.770
What is it?

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:17.780
Prepare yourself!

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:24.160
Ella! Tanaka! It's my car! Stop!

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:29.710
If it isn't the Bullet of Dawn.

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:32.670
That was my name until yesterday.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:34.960
What is it starting today?

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:36.710
Mach Storm!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:42.390
None of that matters. I thought you were one of Eggman's stupid mechas again.

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.180
Please pardon my rudeness.

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:48.560
You never change.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.400
What‘s with that crowd?

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.000
What's all the fuss about?

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.210
What's with all these people?

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:17.090
Beats me.

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:22.510
What's with your car?

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:33.020
I'm thinking of having a race with Sonic.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.860
A race?

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.900
Hey, this engine is…

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:46.080
Right! It's the Super Rocket Engine SS III, developed by the government's Office of Science and Technology.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:56.920
Sonic! Race against me in this car!

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:01.510
Sonic, did you hear my uncle?

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.430
I'm not interested.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.850
Hey, wait up!

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.020
Sonic! Race me!

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.310
What?

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.320
What's going on?

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:22.570
And that's the story.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.620
This will be the race course.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.500
We start from this house...

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:35.210
go into town and on to the freeway...

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.040
cross the border...

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.380
race through the desert...

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:43.840
make one trip around the canyon...

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.640
then return to town.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.930
The finish line is the stadium.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:54.140
The President will be holding the tape at the finish line.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.230
The President?

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.480
I heard he's going to shake hands with the winner.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:07.490
The President's popularity will increase, guaranteeing victory in the next election!

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:11.490
The President's aide would think of something like that.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:18.080
So that's why you were able to borrow the science department's rocket engine.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.130
That's right.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:22.130
Now I'm even less inclined to race.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.970
Sonic, you supersonic guy.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:29.890
Don't you want to win against the rocket engine that the science department created?

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:36.230
Even if you're not physically up for it, your supersonic soul must be excited!

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:38.980
Uncle, you're the only one thinking that!

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:44.030
Isn't it too early in the morning to have a race anyway? You'll disturb the neighbors with all the noise.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.070
That's already taken care of.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:56.870
Station Square residents - make that everyone in the nation - are eagerly awaiting the race between Sonic and the Mach Storm.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:07.880
The sponsor of the race is Starship Soft, the company that holds 70% of the computer market.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.800
Dad... Mom...

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:16.020
It seems we were the only ones who didn't know about this race.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:22.860
That's right! That's why you must race me, supersonic guy!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:23.820
I'm not doing it.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:26.860
You're so irritating!

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:38.790
Vivian.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.670
Vivian, I love you.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.220
Hello?

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:57.020
Sonic says he's not going to race! Do something!

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:59.020
Hello?

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:05.980
Mach Storm gets flustered easily.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:14.240
If Sonic doesn't want to race, that would be a huge problem.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:25.750
What! Sonic's not going to race? If that's true…

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:30.420
How dare you lie to us, President! Make Sonic race!

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:35.640
The President's popularity will decrease, and he will lose the next presidential election.

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:41.520
This is bad! In order to make Sonic race...

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.310
Land!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.690
Sea!

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.110
Air!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:50.740
I'll dispatch the military to convince Sonic.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:56.200
No, the military will cost too much money.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:08:00.120
Oh yeah! It will work if I use him.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.850
Checkmate.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.850
What? Wait a sec!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:23.350
No.

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:27.190
How dare you! You're nothing but a robot to kill time with!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:34.360
Just who do you think created you? I'm going to remodel you and make you weaker!

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:38.410
No! Please don't, Dr. Eggman.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:40.950
Too bad.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:47.080
Eggman, I have a favor to ask you.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.210
Who are you?

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:53.880
I'm the President's aide- No, I meant to say I'm a mysterious person.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:56.970
What do you want?

00:08:57.260 --> 00:09:03.180
Sonic and the fastest man in the government are going to compete in a race. Who do you think will win?

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:05.350
Sonic, of course.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.730
However, Sonic says that he doesn't want to race.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:15.030
He's not the type to comply easily. And?

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:20.200
If you get Sonic to enter the race, I'll treat you to cream puffs.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:24.000
Cream puffs? What makes you think that will convince me?

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.080
I want cream puffs.

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:26.080
- I want to eat them.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.630
This is a great chance to defeat Sonic.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:31.920
We'll work hard for you, Dr. Eggman!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:37.680
But can we really trust you?

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.220
What?

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.890
Look into my eyes and don't say a word!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:48.060
I hate his eyes. Fine, I'll work something out!

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:54.110
I'll remodel the robot which I used to kill time.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:10:00.280
No! No! I don't want that!

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:04.240
Incredible.

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:06.290
It sure looks fast.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:09.170
It runs on the latest space rocket engine.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.460
Not him again.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:19.050
Hey kid, where's Sonic? There's no use hiding him!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.980
I have a message for you from Dr. Eggman!

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:33.270
What's with you? Don't worry. I won't explode today.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:35.570
What's the message?

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:40.240
Hey Sonic, enter the race! If you don't, this is what's gonna happen!

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:47.620
I'm going to kiss you!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.130
Don't come near me!

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.840
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.300
Kiss!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.430
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:09.600
Damn, what a gross set of lips!

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.310
Kiss! Kiss!

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:23.160
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss, kiss, kiss!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:28.790
Even if you're not physically up for it, your supersonic soul must be excited!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.170
Kiss!

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:33.960
I have no choice. The race is better than this!

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:50.640
The engine sounds nice.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.650
Let's hurry up and start.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:11.870
What's up with Sonic? He's suddenly in favor of the race.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:13.920
I guess he likes to compete after all.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.670
On your mark!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.790
Get set!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.800
Start!

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:25.930
That's the spirit.

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:28.850
Sonic! Give it your best shot!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.740
Good morning everyone!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:50.080
We're giving you live race coverage from the sky between Sonic and Mach Storm.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:56.170
After starting from the Thorndyke residence, Sonic and Mach Storm are now speeding along the freeway.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:12:59.920
Hey, leader.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.050
What is it?

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:07.640
You said your car was a rocket car, but isn't it simply just a rocket? You're floating in air.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.810
You idiot. Take a good look.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:25.030
I'm a man who follows the rules.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.910
You're weird.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:30.240
The course ahead is city streets.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:37.330
They will have to zigzag between the buildings.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:42.960
Can Mach Storm do that at high speed?

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:44.840
There's no need to worry about me.

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:47.340
Well, I'm going ahead.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:55.850
Okay! Sonic's gone. Everyone, begin straight strategy!

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:57.520
Roger!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:20.710
Did you forget that I'm the leader of the special highway speed squad S-Team?

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.180
What?

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.100
That wasn't fair!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.770
Yes it was.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.860
Just what do you think you're doing, Sonic?

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:45.480
What a nice breeze.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.200
This isn't fair!

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.910
Yes it is.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.490
Damn.

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:59.920
Okay, you got me. But I can't see if you sit there, so can you move back a bit?

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:03.540
Thanks.

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.170
How's this?

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:08.760
Just a little more.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.090
Around here?

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:15.140
Yeah, thanks. That's fine.

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.650
That went according to plan.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:28.490
Sonic has been sent flying. I wonder if he's okay?

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:36.790
Mach Storm is pretty good! So Sonic falls for those kinds of traps. I'll make a note of that.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:40.460
Okay, go E-45!

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.210
He caught up already?

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:55.930
Hello. Thrust! Thrust!

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:57.810
What's that?

00:15:57.810 --> 00:15:59.060
Damn.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:06.900
Bring it!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.110
Thrust!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.780
So long!

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:27.960
Bring it!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.420
Thrust!

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:39.680
Aww, I don't like this! Oh, I know. I'll fight myself!

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:40.600
Thrust!

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:49.570
That was my first kiss!

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:55.200
It doesn't count as a real kiss.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.320
Forget about it.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:59.120
What a fool.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.410
Is it my fault? Why?

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:05.080
I don't care!

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:21.770
Kiss. Kiss. Kiss...

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:25.890
No... Stop... Kiss. Kiss. Kiss...

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:30.190
Kiss. Kiss. Kiss...

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:35.530
It's already lunchtime.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:46.540
Want to eat, Sonic?

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:47.790
Nope.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:53.170
Come to think of it, I didn't eat breakfast.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.670
Sonic!

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:02.640
Ella made pancakes and yogurt.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.060
Looks delicious. Thank you!

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.440
I'm going ahead!

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.820
Damn that guy!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.900
Sonic, I'll wait for you at the finish line.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:16.900
Okay!

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:28.080
The two are in a dead heat as they head towards the Great Canyon.

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:56.440
They both pass the turning point and head back into the desert.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:03.030
They're racing towards the stadium, which is the finish line!

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:18.630
Where's the President? They're going to reach the finish line soon.

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.310
Hello?

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:31.230
What? The national defense meeting is taking so long that the President won't be able to come?

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:34.190
Okay, I'll work something out.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.230
I have no choice.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:40.320
I'll shake hands with the winner.

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:46.200
Then my popularity will increase.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:50.660
I will run in the next presidential election...

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.880
and I will become...

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:59.380
the President!

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:06.720
What's so funny?

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:12.140
Oh, it's nothing.

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:21.740
Sonic and Mach Storm have just crossed the bridge and are heading towards the stadium!

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.630
Sonic.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:42.670
Sonic... Sorry, but I'm winning win this time!

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:47.010
Mach Storm makes his final push!

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:49.100
Not bad!

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:12.950
They reached the finish line almost simultaneously! I don't know who won!

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.960
This was a photo finish.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:18.840
Please turn your attention to the big screen!

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:38.310
Oh my! Sonic crossed the finish line and then nonchalantly came back to flash a victory sign. Sonic is the winner!

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:48.030
Sonic!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:49.820
Cut it out, Amy.

00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:50.990
Sonic.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:54.540
Congratulations!

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:57.080
Thank you.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:04.670
Sonic!

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:09.010
Let's have a victory handshake.

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:20.310
What are you waiting for? Hurry up and shake my hand so that they can take photos.

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:25.190
Hello?

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:27.990
Vivian, what's up?

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:33.490
I'm fired? They found out that I was negotiating with Eggman?

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:42.090
My dream of becoming President is over! Vivian!

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:44.590
Who's Vivian?

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:29.550 --> 00:25:35.430
Summer Vacation! Chao Observation Diary
